# The images build from the repository root (deploy/Dockerfile) and install
# their own dependencies, so nothing built or installed on the host goes in —
# the host's node_modules hold other platforms' binaries — nor anything they
# don't build from. `**/` reaches into the workspace packages; a bare name
# matches at the root only (docs/research/node-docker-pnpm.md).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-demo
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.DS_Store
.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude
.env
.env.*
docs
deploy
infra
